{'symbol': 'PPL', 'date': '2022-02-23 18:37:00', 'title': 'PPL CORPORATION RECEIVES APPROVAL FROM RHODE ISLAND DIVISION OF PUBLIC UTILITIES AND CARRIERS TO ACQUIRE THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY', 'text': 'ALLENTOWN, PA., FEB. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PPL CORPORATION (NYSE: PPL) TODAY RECEIVED APPROVAL FROM THE RHODE ISLAND DIVISION OF PUBLIC UTILITIES AND CARRIERS TO ACQUIRE THE NARRAGANSETT ELECTRIC COMPANY FROM NATIONAL GRID USA.'}